{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Candy &amp; Toys Store Simulator! </strong><br><br><strong>Candy &amp; Toys Store Simulator </strong>is a business simulation where you run and grow your own candy and toy store in a calm, cozy, and lively environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle daily operations such as stocking shelves, setting prices, serving customers, and organizing your store to maximize efficiency and profit. As you progress, you can hire employees and unlock new opportunities to expand and improve your store operations. <br>\u200e\u200e <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013700/extras/657497c6ae909237c6c3c2a6bbd70f96.webp?t=1766347499\" width=800 height=4 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Layout &amp; Design:</strong> <br>Optimize the layout of your candy and toys store for efficiency and visual appeal. Design your space to maximize usability, organize aisles strategically, place products wisely, and create a smooth, enjoyable shopping experience for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013700/extras/0b0d86550a972c66d153cc59be8190a6.poster.avif?t=1766347499\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013700/extras/0b0d86550a972c66d153cc59be8190a6.webm?t=1766347499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013700/extras/0b0d86550a972c66d153cc59be8190a6.mp4?t=1766347499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e\u200e\u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto